---
title: "return_obligation (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_unpack: ObligationHotPotato { obligation_id } = obligation_hot_potato
    q_unpack --> q_check_id: obligation_id == object::id(obligation)
    q_check_id --> q_share: IDs match
    q_check_id --> q_abort_mismatch: IDs do not match
    q_abort_mismatch --> [*]: abort invalid_obligation_error
    q_share --> [*]: transfer::public_share_object(obligation)

    note right of q_check_id
        INV-001: hot potato obligation_id must match the obligation being shared
        INV-002: ensures obligation is always shared, never kept as owned
    end note
